Attribution notes (not license terms):

- gadget/descriptors.h: the 507-byte report descriptor is a hardware fact
  captured from a physical DualShock 4 v2 (USB); the 467-byte variant and
  the 49-byte feature-0xA3 firmware blob originate from the ViGEmBus
  project (MIT, https://github.com/nefarius/ViGEmBus). Hardware facts
  (VID/PID, descriptor bytes) are not copyrightable subject matter; the
  ViGEmBus-derived blobs are used under its MIT license with attribution.
- The gadget-shim is original code written against the Linux kernel
  UAPI (configfs/FunctionFS), informed by the public documentation of
  the kernel's functionfs sample and by studying the SenseShock project
  (https://github.com/muhammad23012009/senseshock) as prior art for the
  gadget topology. No SenseShock code is included.
